{"message":"The table reconciles the asset retirement liability changes: beginning balance $5.5 million, additional obligations $0.5 million, accretion $1.2 million, ending balance $7.2 million. Net change = ending balance - beginning balance = $7.2 - $5.5 = $1.7 million.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"7.2 - 5.5","sources":{"7.2":"source:t3c1n0","5.5":"source:t0c1n0"}}}